cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Reproducibility package for "From Robust Architecture to Adaptive Pathways:
  Designing a Modular Grain Sampler Under Deep Uncertainty"
message: If you use this software or data, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Mateus Antônio da Silva
    family-names: Nogueira
